*>   4 walk speed, 5 hasChest); EF4-SPIT-OPS IN(xRot deg, yRot deg) OUT(count, then code 1 translate 2 rotate Y deg 3 rotate Z deg and three values each); EF4-SPIT-TEXTURE path(out X(120)).


